      "description": "Visual state sample of the project selector; source JavaScript supplies selection and keyboard behavior.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Project examples\"><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">Water heaters</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Fixtures</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Pipework</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{display:flex;background:var(--paper,#f4f5f7);}.ds-tabs button{flex:1;padding:14px 8px;border:0;border-bottom:3px solid transparent;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#536074);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.6;cursor:pointer;transition:background .18s;font-family:var(--font,Geist,Arial,sans-serif);}.ds-tabs button[aria-selected=true]{border-color:var(--red,#ba1527);color:var(--navy,#0b2145);background:#e9edf2;}.ds-tabs button:hover{background:#dce3ec;}.ds-tabs button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#287cce);outline-offset:6px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-tabs button{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Service Disclosure",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Native details disclosure with thin dividers and a plus/minus indicator.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-disclosures\"><details><summary>Water heaters<span class=\"ds-expand\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Traditional or tankless, gas or electric. Talk with us about repairs, replacement, or an upgrade that fits your property.</p></details></div>",
      "css": ".ds-disclosures{border-top:1px solid var(--navy,#0b2145);color:var(--navy,#0b2145);font-family:var(--font,Geist,Arial,sans-serif);}.ds-disclosures details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#d5dae1);}.ds-disclosures summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:24px;padding:26px 0;font-size:23px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.035em;}.ds-disclosures summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}.ds-disclosures summary:hover{color:var(--red,#ba1527);}.ds-disclosures summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#287cce);outline-offset:6px;}.ds-expand{position:relative;flex-shrink:0;width:20px;height:20px;}.ds-expand:before,.ds-expand:after{position:absolute;content:\"\";background:currentColor;width:16px;height:1.5px;left:2px;top:9px;}.ds-expand:after{transform:rotate(90deg);transition:transform .2s;}.ds-disclosures details[open] .ds-expand:after{transform:rotate(0deg);}.ds-disclosures p{margin:0;padding:0 35px 28px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted,#536074);}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-expand:after{transition:none;}}"
